            <span class="meta-text">OCI Legal Guides &bull; Guide 14</span>
            <h1 class="article-title mt-2">OCI Card Cancellation Under Section 7D: Grounds, Criminal Proceedings and Legal Remedies</h1>
            <p class="article-subtitle">
                Learn how Section 7D affects OCI cardholders facing criminal proceedings, cancellation notices, blacklisting or immigration restrictions, and understand the legal remedies that may be available.
            </p>
            <div class="article-meta-row">
                <div class="article-meta-item">
                    <i class="bi bi-person-fill text-gold"></i>
                    <span>RRC Law Associates Legal Editorial Team</span>
                </div>
                <div class="article-meta-item">
