                    <span>OCI Legal Guides Series</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Featured Cover Image -->
            <div class="featured-image-wrapper">
                <img src="assets/images/oci-card-cancellation-section-7d-legal-remedies.jpg" alt="OCI cancellation under Section 7D, criminal proceedings and legal remedies" class="featured-image">
                <div class="featured-image-caption">
                    Section 7D of the Citizenship Act, 1955, Notification S.O. 3662(E), criminal proceeding thresholds, natural justice safeguards and High Court judicial review.
                </div>
